Package: microhaplot
Type: Package
Title: Microhaplotype Constructor and Visualizer
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Thomas", "Ng", email = "tngthomasng@gmail.com", role = "aut",
           comment = "Original author of microhaplot"),
    person("Eric C.", "Anderson", role = "aut",
           comment = "Original author of microhaplot"),
    person("Loic", "Talignani", email = "loic.talignani@ird.fr",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = "Maintainer of microhaplot 2; population genetics
                      modules, field genotyping prep app, Docker packaging"))
Description: A downstream bioinformatics tool to construct and assist
    curation of microhaplotypes from short read sequences. This is
    microhaplot 2, an extended fork of the original package: it adds a
    population genetics module (F-statistics, allelic diversity, PCA and
    outlier detection), a guided field genotyping prep app, BAM input
    support, and a Docker distribution that needs no local R installation.
